title: WhiteWomenEncounter
---
<<declare $wwNumber = 0>>
<<set $wwNumber = random_range(0, 3)>>
<<if $wwNumber == 0>>
Get away from me!
<<elseif $wwNumber == 1>>
You won’t trick me. I know what you are.
